    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29142" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mĭnĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A small river in Etruria</i>, now <i>Mignone</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Minionis in arvis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 183</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Rutil. 1,
			279</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A town on the river Minio</i>, Mela, 2, 4,
		9.</div>
